                      ),
                    ),
                  ),
                ),
              ),
              Container(
                margin: EdgeInsets.only(left: 25, right: 25, top: 10),
                width: double.infinity,
                height: 50,
                decoration: BoxDecoration(
                    border: Border.all(color: Globals.appColor, width: 2),
